-- Synthex production DB remediation preflight.
-- Read-only. Run before applying any remediation SQL.
--
-- This file verifies that the live database is in the expected blocked state:
-- populated schema, no migration ledgers, and the 26 source-mapped Supabase
-- table targets still missing.

